# Lifeblood speech: combat. The format and every fact and word are described in basics.speech.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Combat barks. [enemy] is who or what they're fighting.

== fight ==
[exclaim] [enemy.a.cap]!
Here comes [enemy.a]!
I'll handle this!            {brave}
Come on, then!               {brave, !polite}
Stand back!                  {brave, polite}
For the [faction]!           {has_faction=yes, brave}
Oh no, oh no, oh no...       {timid}
Why is it always me?         {timid, pessimist}
Watch out, [enemy.a]!        {!brave}
Cube God, guide my arm!      {pious, brave}
You picked the wrong fight!  {proud}
Watch and learn.             {competitive}
I've been waiting for this.  {vengeful}
Not again...                 {lazy}
To arms!                     {proper, brave}
Get 'em!                     {crude}
Come here, you bastard!      {crude+, brave}
Oh, hell.                    {crude, timid}
Right. Somebody's getting hurt. {hothead}
You want a fight? You've got one, damn it! {hothead, crude}

== flee ==
[taught_scared]! Run!          {w=4}
[taught_scared]!               {w=3}
Run!
I'm out of here!
Nope! Nope!                  {lighthearted}
Too many! Fall back!         {brave}
Help!                        {timid}
Cube God save me!            {pious}
Every one for themselves!    {!polite}
Retreat! Retreat!            {proper}
Oh, hell no!                 {crude}
Screw this!                  {crude+}
I can't do this!             {timid, pessimist}
Run! Don't look back!        {polite}

== low_health ==
[taught_scared]! I'm hurt!    {w=4}
I'm hurt!
I'm hurt bad!
Can't take much more of this!
Ugh... that hurt.
Is that all you've got?      {brave, proud}
Just a scratch!              {brave, optimist}
I don't want to die here!    {timid}
This is it, isn't it?        {pessimist}
Somebody help!               {!brave}
Cube God, not yet...         {pious}
Damn it, that hurt!          {crude}
Bloody hell...               {crude+}

== victory ==
[taught_happy]!               {w=3}
[taught_happy]! Got it!       {w=3}
Got it!
Down it goes.
Ha! Next!                    {brave}
That's how it's done!        {proud}
Phew. That was close.        {timid}
That'll teach you.           {vengeful}
Rest in peace, [enemy].      {forgiving}
The Cube God provides.       {pious}
One less [enemy] in the world. {serious}
That's one for me.           {competitive}
Keep up, [address].          {competitive, rude}

== hit_by_friend ==
[taught_angry]! Watch it!     {w=4}
[taught_angry], [listener]!    {w=3}
Hey! Watch it!
Ow! What was that for?
Careful!
Do that again and see what happens. {rude}
Hey! I'm on your side!       {opinion=friendly}
Ow! [listener]!              {opinion=friend}
That's going on my list, [listener]. {vengeful}
I'll forget that, just this once. {forgiving}
Was that really necessary?   {proper}
Oi! Knock it off!            {crude}
What the hell, [listener]?   {crude}
Do that again. I dare you.   {hothead, w=2}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Being downed, getting up, and rescue

== downed ==
[taught_sad]...               {w=3}
Agh!
Ugh...
I'm down!
Not... like... this...       {lighthearted}
So... tired...               {lazy}
Cube God...                  {pious}
Tell my [favorite_food] I loved [favorite_food.it]... {glutton, lighthearted, w=2}
I'll... get you... for this... {vengeful}
Help...                      {timid}
Ah, damn...                  {crude}

== get_up ==
I'm... I'm all right.
Ow. Ow. Ow.
I need to lie down somewhere softer. Home.
That's it, I'm going home.
I'll be fine. Just need some rest.
Still alive. Barely.         {pessimist}
Ha! Can't keep me down!      {optimist}
Thank the Cube God.          {pious}
I'll remember that one.      {vengeful}

== thanks_saved ==
You saved my life, [listener]!
I owe you one, [listener]. A big one.
Thank you. I mean it.        {serious}
I thought I was done for. Thank you, [listener]. {timid}
I had it handled! ...But thanks. {proud}
Thank the Cube God, and thank you. {pious}
I won't forget this, [listener]. {sentimental, w=2}
I'm in your debt.            {proper}
You're a lifesaver, literally. {lighthearted}

== grief ==
[taught_sad]... [victim]...   {w=3}
No... [victim]...
[victim]! No!
Not [victim]...
[victim]... Cube God keep you. {pious}
Whoever did this will pay.   {vengeful, w=2}
Why does this always happen? {pessimist}
Rest well, [victim].         {forgiving}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Eating

== eat ==
Mm.
Food.
[food.cap]! My favorite!     {taste=love, w=3}
Mmm, [food].                 {taste=like, w=2}
Not bad.                     {taste=like}
[food.cap]. It's food.       {taste=meh, w=2}
Ugh. [food.cap]. If I must.  {taste=dislike, w=2}
I hate [food]. Hate it.      {taste=hate, w=3}
Bleh.                        {taste=hate}
Food, glorious food!         {glutton, w=2}
Thank the Cube God for [food]. {pious}
Om nom nom.                  {lighthearted}
